# Port patch, decision of the project owner (14.11.2026: Professional's quick-time events "Mit Touch Bedienung nicht zu
# schaffen und mit Controller gerade noch schaffbar. Koennen wir das entschaerfen?"): the switch "Gentler QTEs" of the
# app's comfort controls (on by default). The game's difficulty rank pG->Game_level (Normal 1..10 from the player's
# points, starting at 5; Professional fixed at 10) sets the quick-time events' time windows and press counts at these
# sites only: Salazar's statue run (r226 ButtonCount), the boulder run (emrock plemRockEscape), swimming back to the
# boat after Del Lago (pl0f plboat_R2_Swim), climbing back onto the minecart (objTrolley plobjTrolleyEscape), Krauser's
# knife hold, four-swing combo, arm attacks, low kick and cliff (em39), El Gigante's parasite (em2b) and U-3's lunge,
# ceiling and ground prompts (em32). They read re4_qte_level() (runtime/qte_touch.cpp) instead: the game's rank, with
# the switch on in Professional at most Normal's start (5). Damage, the enemies' behaviour and everything else keep
# reading pG->Game_level. With the switch off nothing changes.
